# Settings shared by the demo tapes, which include it with Source. VHS
# takes settings only before the first command, so a tape that sets more
# does so right after the Source line.

Require silt

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
